    "end": 5.616,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "to argue or fight among the couples?",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_1",
    "start": 7.278,
    "end": 8.319,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "That was the question, right?",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_2",
    "start": 8.459,
    "end": 9.6,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Yes, about relationships.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_3",
    "start": 9.62,
    "end": 10.521,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "About relationships.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_4",
    "start": 12.843,
    "end": 16.447,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Then maybe a good opportunity to meditate on patience also.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_5",
    "start": 18.815,
    "end": 19.996,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "or understanding, right?",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_6",
    "start": 21.456,
    "end": 37.543,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Also, Patoor Rinpoche's story, one time that one man is sort of meditating in the hermitage, and Patoor Rinpoche asked him, What are you meditating on?",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_7",
    "start": 37.783,
    "end": 40.504,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "He said, Oh, I'm meditating on Zobah, patience.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_8",
    "start": 42.044,
    "end": 43.345,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And then he whispered in his ear,",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_9",
    "start": 44.202,
    "end": 46.643,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "People like you and me can fool people these days.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_10",
    "start": 47.103,
    "end": 51.704,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And he got so angry, why are you coming here and bothering me?",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_11",
    "start": 56.925,
    "end": 66.627,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So I think, as a practitioner, as a Buddhist, as a practitioner, when things go well,",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_12",
    "start": 67.807,
    "end": 76.032,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "then we don't really know how good our practice is or how much depth there is when in practice.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_13",
    "start": 76.212,
    "end": 80.254,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So when circumstances arise, that's the time I think we have to use.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_14",
    "start": 81.735,
    "end": 91.441,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So sometimes I think if you want to see how deep or how good you are, then some challenge may be.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_15",
    "start": 94.742,
    "end": 97.725,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "something that will stir up your negative emotions.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_16",
    "start": 98.205,
    "end": 100.868,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And then you can see whether you can handle it or not.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_17",
    "start": 101.829,
    "end": 107.094,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And some of the lojong practice, lojong teaching, it's almost like you have to look for trouble.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_18",
    "start": 108.499,
    "end": 109.1,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Almost like that.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_19",
    "start": 109.14,
    "end": 116.948,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Not really you poke on somebody, but you almost look for trouble, and you're fully ready to challenge any problem.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_20",
    "start": 117.408,
    "end": 124.256,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So when the problem arises, you say, OK, now I can use my Lojong tactics.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_21",
    "start": 127.285,
    "end": 132.387,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "against the negative emotions.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_22",
    "start": 132.927,
    "end": 137.869,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So this is the main purpose of practice, becoming a better practitioner.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_23",
    "start": 138.289,
    "end": 146.352,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I have many friends, Westerners, Easterners, disciples of Khyentse Rinpoche, many.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_24",
    "start": 147.372,
    "end": 152.794,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I don't really see them levitating or having a hollow on their head.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_25",
    "start": 153.633,
    "end": 159.095,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "But I've seen them becoming a better human being, less attached to the worldly life.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_26",
    "start": 159.115,
    "end": 164.557,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So I think that's the result of the practice.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_27",
    "start": 165.477,
    "end": 174.84,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So I think the problem is, if you can look at it as a challenge, being a Buddhist practitioner, not much fear.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_28",
    "start": 175.881,
    "end": 182.503,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And of course, being most important, not much hope and fear.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_29",
    "start": 185.949,
    "end": 191.515,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Rinpoche, thank you so much for sharing the Dharma with us tonight.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  }
]

